<div class="row justify-content-center mt-4">
    <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-7 text-center">
        <div class="card shadow-lg p-4 p-md-5 border-emerald" style="border-top: 4px solid #ef4444 !important;">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <span class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle p-3" style="background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);">
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill text-danger fs-1"></i>
                </span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="fw-bold text-white mb-2">Eliminar Autor</h3>
            <p class="text-secondary mb-3">¿Está seguro que desea eliminar permanentemente este autor del sistema?</p>
            
            <div class="card p-3 mb-4 border-emerald" style="background-color: var(--input-bg);">
                <div class="text-secondary small mb-1">Autor a eliminar:</div>
                <div class="text-emerald fw-bold fs-5">"{{autor.nombre}}"</div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-warning small mb-4">
                <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i> Esta acción no se puede deshacer.
            </p>
            
            <form action="/autores/delete/{{autor.id}}" method="POST" class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
                <a href="/autores" class="btn btn-secondary px-4">
                    <i class="bi bi-x-lg me-1"></i> Cancelar
                </a>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger px-4">
                    <i class="bi bi-trash3-fill me-1"></i> Confirmar Eliminación
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
